    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but the lead times from my suppliers in shenzhen are pretty unpredictable sometimes. like, we'll expect a shipment on a tuesday and it just doesn't show up for another week for no clear reason. how do i account for those random delays in the safety stock math without just overordering everything and tying up all my cash?",
